---
ogImage: "/assets/img/og/web-design.jpg"
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Website Design in Sioux Falls, SD | Couch & Craft"
description: "Websites for Sioux Falls service businesses. I write the copy and build the site. You get one person from first call to launch."
crumb: "Web Design"
service:
  name: "Website design"
  type: "Web design"
  description: "Websites for Sioux Falls service businesses, with the copy, design, build and Google setup handled by one person."
---
{%- set hofba = site.work | findBySlug("hall-of-fame-billiard-academy") -%}
{%- set nate = site.work | findBySlug("nate-hall-insurance") -%}
<section class="page-hero band--navy" aria-labelledby="page-heading">
  <div class="container page-hero__inner page-hero__inner--split">
    <div class="flow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Web design</p>
      <h1 id="page-heading">Websites for {{ site.business.city }} service businesses.</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__sub">For owners who know their trade and don't want to become web people. I handle the words, the design, the build and the Google setup.</p>
      <p class="hero__actions">
        <a class="button button--gold" href="/start/" data-track="cta_click" data-label="web-design-hero">Start a project</a>
        <a class="button button--secondary" href="/pricing/">See pricing</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="shot-stack" aria-label="Screenshots of sites I've built" role="group">
      <img class="shot-stack__back" src="/assets/img/work/source/playpoolnation-desktop.png" alt="PlayPoolNation venue directory homepage" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 30rem, 80vw" loading="eager">
      <img class="shot-stack__front" src="/assets/img/work/source/nate-hall-insurance-desktop.png" alt="Nate Hall Insurance website on desktop" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 30rem, 80vw" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
      <img class="shot-stack__phone" src="/assets/img/work/source/nate-hall-insurance-mobile.png" alt="Nate Hall Insurance website on a phone" sizes="8rem" loading="eager">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band checklist" aria-labelledby="includes-heading">
  <div class="container checklist__inner">
    <h2 id="includes-heading">What's in every build</h2>
    <ul class="checklist__list">
      {%- for item in site.webDesign.includes %}
      <li>{{ item | open }}</li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% if not site.webDesign.includesConfirmed %}<p class="review-note">[JUSTIN TO CONFIRM: this list, then set webDesign.includesConfirmed to true]</p>{% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--white" aria-labelledby="packages-heading">
  <div class="container flow" style="--flow-space: var(--space-l)">
    <div class="flow">
      <h2 id="packages-heading">Foundation or Signature</h2>
      <p class="lead">Two ways to build. Here's exactly what's in each, so you can compare before we talk.</p>
    </div>
    {%- set rows = site.webDesign.packages | packageRows(site.pricing) -%}
    {% set table = { caption: "Foundation vs Signature", columns: ["Foundation", "Signature"], rows: rows } %}
    {% include "partials/compare-table.njk" %}
    <p><a class="text-link" href="/pricing/">Full pricing, including care plans</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

{% set processHeading = "How a build goes" %}
{% include "partials/process.njk" %}

<section class="band band--white" aria-labelledby="hofba-heading">
  <div class="container callout">
    <div class="flow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Before</p>
      <h2 id="hofba-heading">What I look for on an old site</h2>
      <p>This was {{ hofba.contact }}'s site before I rebuilt it. Each pin is something a visitor would notice in the first few seconds.</p>
      <p><a class="text-link" href="/work/{{ hofba.slug }}/">Read the {{ hofba.client }} story</a></p>
    </div>
    {% set annotation = annotations["hofba-before-desktop"] %}{% set pinsSizes = "(min-width: 1024px) 44rem, 100vw" %}
    {% include "partials/pins.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<div class="band">
  <div class="container">
    {%- set faqs = [
      { q: "Do you handle hosting?", a: "<p>[JUSTIN TO SET: hosting answer]</p>" },
      { q: "What if I need changes after launch?", a: "<p>[JUSTIN TO SET: how edits after launch work and what they cost]</p>" },
      { q: "Do I own my website?", a: "<p>" + (site.pricing.ownershipPolicy | open) + "</p>" },
      { q: "Do you use AI?", a: "<p>Yes, for parts of the work, like research and first drafts. I check, rewrite and test everything myself before you see it. Nothing goes live that I haven't read.</p>" },
      { q: "I already have a website. Do I need a new one?", a: "<p>Maybe not. Send me your site. If you don't need a new one, I'll tell you. Sometimes the fix is better words and a working contact form, not a rebuild.</p><p><a href=\"/teardown/\">Get a free teardown</a></p>" }
    ] -%}
    {% set faqId = "web-design-faq" %}
    {% include "partials/faq.njk" %}
  </div>
</div>

<section class="band band--white related" aria-label="Keep reading">
  <div class="container related__inner">
    <a class="related__link" href="/work/">See the sites I've built</a>
    <a class="related__link" href="/pricing/">See what it costs</a>
    <a class="related__link" href="/websites-for-contractors/">Websites for contractors</a>
    <a class="related__link" href="/websites-for-insurance-agents/">Websites for insurance agents</a>
  </div>
</section>
